WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.843
Grain means what one row represents A sales fact
table may have one

00:00:05.869 --> 00:00:11.871
row per transaction After grouping the grain may
become one product-month

00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:19.383
After pivoting months into columns the grain may
become one product If

00:00:19.409 --> 00:00:23.225
you cannot state the row grain it is difficult to
know whether a reshape is

00:00:23.238 --> 00:00:23.764
correct
